      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\ndocument_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Structured Document Extraction\ndocument_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Structured Document Extraction\nexpense_record_store.py - Persist normalized expense records in a managed document store\nextract_invoice_fields.py - extracts vendor, date, total, and line-item fields from an invoice\nextract_receipt_fields.py - extracts merchant, tax, total, and items from a receipt\ninvoice_note_translate.py - Translate extracted invoice notes or descriptions\ninvoice_summary.py - Summarize extracted invoice fields\nnormalize_expense.py - normalizes extracted expense fields into a standard JSON schema\nvalidate_document_fields.py - validates required structured fields and confidence scores\nvendor_text_safety.py - Moderate vendor notes or memo fields\n\nCreate extract_receipt_fields.py in the current working directory.\nTask: extracts merchant, tax, total, and items from a receipt.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc604fe0001BtB0sO67jh0762",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc604fdd001oJqYz8v8SpIAMa",
