    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a Python file named extract_receipt_fields.py that extracts specific fields from a receipt using a concrete external provider. The provider must be identifiable in the code. I will use the Amazon Textract service, which is a powerful tool for extracting text and data from documents. I will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Textract client to perform the extraction. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789866830054,
          "start": 1789866824745
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc605429001RKialUytRb2Jiq",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc604feb001OXZ9NsLknrFo68",
      "session_id": "ses_f439fb032ffea7ty1QIm4I9XdT",
